
                                                  COMPRESET COMMAND


Reset compatibility between infoblocks.


Below is the syntax :
                                compreset -reset {"true"|"false"}

---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES       |    DESCRIPTION
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  
   -reset        |    Reset compatibility between all the infoblocks.
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:
    read -in medc18.hex
    blklink -start 0x0060C100 -next 0x00610100
    blklink -start 0x00610100 -next 0x0
    writecks -fc set
    compreset -reset true    
    write -out output.hex -lyt 0x20
    
